<title>FRANCE: Moroccan importers buy 20,000 tonnes French wheat.</title>
<headline>Moroccan importers buy 20,000 tonnes French wheat.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private Moroccan operators bought on Thursday 20,000 tonnes of French soft wheat at $160 per tonne, including cost and freight, European grain traders said.</p>
<p>The wheat is for delivery by November 25, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
